:"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-05-13T22:31:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T16:48:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.4.0 and 4.4.1.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - AMD Ryzen 9 7940HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the new ignore_time_scale feature on Timers, and the Timer is set to use the Physics Process, it updates far slower then it should.\n\nAt this speed it seems to be ~2.5x - 3x slower then it should be.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In a new Project, add a Timer to the scene, and set process_callback to Physics and ignore_time_scale to true.\n2. In a script in _ready, set Engine.time_scale = 50.0\n3. In _physics_process or _process, do print(timer.time_left)\n4. Run and observe the output.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[timertest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20265454/timertest.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106368/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106368/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}